  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "A guest named Jay Anderson, speaking on podcast host Jesse Michels's show, recalls Operation Snow White, which he describes as a 1970s effort by Scientology, a religious movement, to infiltrate several US agencies. According to Anderson, these included the IRS, the US tax agency, and the CIA, the US foreign intelligence agency. He raises it as an example of how deeply outside groups could get inside the government."
